      "date": "2026-02-04T12:22:20.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹4.50 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹4.50. Ex-date: 9th February 2026 Payment date: 2nd March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.4%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.9%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (4% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (27% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 3.1% per year over the past 8 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 86% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
