      "date": "2026-02-01T18:03:28.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.99 (vs ₹4.01 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.99 (down from ₹4.01 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.64b (down 20% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹729.2m (down 50% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (down from 18% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 29% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 18% growth forecast for the Aerospace & Defense industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 15% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 45% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
